<div class="login-wrap"><div class="login-stack"><img class="login-logo" src="assets/logo-scaffoldsync.png" alt="ScaffoldSync"><section class="login-card"><div class="login-intro"><h1>Buat Akun Pelanggan</h1><p>Daftarkan akun untuk mengajukan dan memantau penyewaan scaffolding.</p></div><form method="post"><?= csrf_field() ?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="register"><label>Nama Lengkap</label><input class="field" name="nama" placeholder="Nama sesuai identitas" required><label>Nama Perusahaan</label><input class="field" name="perusahaan" placeholder="Nama perusahaan (opsional)"><label>Email</label><input class="field" name="email" type="email" placeholder="nama@email.com" required><label>Nomor Telepon</label><input class="field" name="telepon" placeholder="08xxxxxxxxxx"><label>Password</label><input class="field" name="password" type="password" minlength="6" required><label>Konfirmasi Password</label><input class="field" name="password_confirmation" type="password" minlength="6" required><button class="btn primary full">Daftar Akun</button></form><a class="forgot" href="?page=login">Sudah punya akun? Masuk</a></section></div></div>
